{
 "id": "ec1a1c2d-5b0b-48ab-a3c9-e54c3606689c",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Empress Maria"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "폐황후 마리아"
   },
   {
    "ko-ro": "Pyehwanghu Maria"
   },
   {
    "en": "Deposed Empress Maria"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Wait, from now on, I will inflict divine punishment.\"\n\nMaria, who had lived her best as the empress of the empire, as the emperor's wife. However, all that returned to her was the cruel betrayal of her husband and friend, and in the end, she only watched the deaths of her beloved ones. Maria, who was so thoroughly used by others, eventually gains the title of deposed empress and is dragged to another country. However, the red-haired man 'Gunther' she met there brought back truths different from the memories of the past that Maria knew, and Maria, at the edge of despair, wants to live once again. And her heart races at the thought of living and taking revenge.\n\n---\nAfter dedicating her life as the Empress and loyal wife, Maria is betrayed by her husband and closest friend, witnessing the deaths of her loved ones. Stripped of her title and exiled, she meets a red-haired man named Gunther, who reveals truths that challenge her past. From the depths of despair, Maria finds the will to live again, driven by a burning desire for revenge.",
   "ko": "\"기다려, 이제부터는 내가 천벌을 내릴 테니까.\"\n\n제국의 황후로서, 황제의 아내로서 최선을 다해 살아 온 마리아.  하지만 그녀에게 돌아온 것은 남편과 친구의 처절한 배신 뿐이었고, 종국에는 사랑하는 이들의 죽음만을 지켜본다.  마리아는 그렇게 타인에게 철저히 이용당한 채, 결국에는 폐황후의 칭호를 얻으며 타국으로 끌려\u001d간다.   하지만 그곳에서 만난 붉은 머리의 사내 '군터'는 마리아가 알고 있던 과거의 기억과는 다른 진실들을 떠오르게 하고,  마리아는 절망의 끝자락에서 다시 한번 살고 싶어진다. 그리고 살아서, 복수 하겠다는 생각에 심장이 뛴다."
  },
